  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama w'amahe nagamba ati, “Omu makiro galinya amagufa g'abakama ba Yuda, n'ag'abatwazi bayo n'ag'abakuhani, n'ag'abarangi, n'ag'abantu ba Yerusalemu baligaziikura omu nyanga zabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baganaganage omu nsi; gararamire eizoba n'okwezi n'enyanyinyi zona. Ebyo nibyo bagonzaga, nibyo bakoleraga, nibyo baraguzagaho mara nibyo bafukamiraga. Amagufa ago tibaligashomboza anga kugaziika. Galiikara aha itaka nk'obushai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omuzarwa ogubi ogu, bona abahonokire, hona mbali mbaanaganagiire, balyegomba orufu kushaga oburora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira kugambira abantube nti, “Abantu kabagwa tibaimuka? Isi k'omuntu ahaba tagaruka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu abantu aba nka bansigireho limoi limoi? Bazigiliire ebihuuku, bayanga kungarukaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbahuliliize kurungi kyonkai tibakagambire mazima. Taliho muntu alikwebaza byo alikukora akechuza mafuge. Buli omoi nakwata muhandagwe nk'efarasi elikuturuntuka egiire omu ndashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangu n'amashega gamanya ekirumo kyago eky'okugarukiramu. Ebiiba, entaratamba n'entuha nabyo byekomya obukiro bwabyo bw'okugarukiramu. Kyonkai eihanga lyange tilimanya byo inye Omukama mbaragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakugamba mutai okwo muli bamanyi n'okwo mulikumanya Amateka gange? Muraleba, abegesa b'Amateka enkurumbuzi bahindwire Amateka gange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamanyi nibaija kuhemuka, mara batwarwe endore. Barashoberwa, kuba bangire ebyo Omukama agambire. Bumanyiki obwo bainabwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo abakazi babo ndabaha abashaija abandi, n'endimiro zabo nzihe ababisha babo. Kwema aha mujege muno kugoba ahali rubamba, buli omoi nakurumbura. Kubandiza aha murangi kuhika aha mukuhani, buli omoi nagobeza abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabeiyabeiya abantu bange bati, ‘Mugire emilembe, mugire emilembe,’ okwo emilembe etaliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabahemukire bakakwatwa enshoni? Chei, tibakwetwe nshoni n'ak'okuziza, n'okubwerabwera kwonkai, chei! Aha rw'ekyo baligwa egangali nk'okwo abandi baragwire. Kir'ekyo ndibaha ekibonabonyio, balifa bahweho. Alikugamba n'inye Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Ndabamaliraho kimoi, babe nk'omuzabibu anga omutini oguhoirweho ebiraba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho n'aho nikwo kwebaza bati, “Mbwenu ekyatwikaza aha kiki? Mwije inywena tugye omu bigo by'eboma tube nimwo tugwa. Enshonga Omukama Ruhanga waitu aturamwire kufa, n'amaizi g'okunywa yatuha againamu obumara, tumufakaliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tubaire nitushubira emilembe byabura nshai. Twashubira kukira, mbwenu leba enaku zishai! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nituhulira efarasi z'ababisha zemire Dani nizikuntira. Enumi zazo kazilikujuga, ensi etengeta yona. Ensi yona nibaija kugita omwebuura, n'ebikagilimu babisilikye, hamoi n'ekigo n'abantu bamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye nyenene Omukama, ndabasindikira enjoka ezitarumuuzibwa, zibateme.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obujune nyina obw'okunyita, obushasi bundi kubi omu mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhulire ab'eihanga lyange nibachura ensi yona, bati, “Omukama takili Sioni? Takisingiiremu?” Omukama Ruhanga wabo nahorora ati, “Kubaki munnigaize? Nimufukamira ebishushani ebiheshano n'ebihuuku bya baruhanga abanyamahanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nibashuba nibachura bati, “Eigesha lihoire n'ekyanda kyahwa, kyonkai titukaboine bujuni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyina obujune bungi muno aha rw'enaku z'eihanga lyange. Ndiyo ninchura nintaba akanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Gileadi, omubazi tigukizokamu? N'omutambi chei? Mbwenu aho kubaki ab'eihanga lyange batakatambiirwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
